1	// pattern: Imperative Shell
2	//
3	// Gathers: JSON signed proof + destination server DID + current time
4	// Processes: syntax/freshness/local-account checks → signature verification → authoritative PLC
5	//            rotation-set lookup → atomic active-account recheck + nonce consume + full session
6	// Returns: the standard full-access legacy session response
7	
