4	// actual handle/DID lookup here so resolveHandle, resolveIdentity, refreshIdentity, and resolveDid
5	// all use the same local → network fallback rules. The `atproto-proxy` header target guard (SSRF
6	// validation + DNS-pinning client) lives in the sibling `proxy` module.
